[2026-06-26 13:05] REVIEWER: System: Multi-tenant CRDT Collaborative Workspace

[2026-06-26 13:05] REVIEWER: === ARCHITECTURE REVIEW ===
  - CRDT-based: ✅ правильный выбор для collaborative editing
  - Event-driven rejected: ❌ total order dependency — fatal for distributed
  - Lock-based rejected: ❌ UX disaster for real-time collab
  - Fractional index: ✅ O(1) insert, no rebalancing needed
  - HLC: ✅ better than Lamport clock (physical time context)

[2026-06-26 13:05] REVIEWER: === PRODUCTION RISKS ===
  🔴 HIGH: In-memory storage — single point of failure, data loss on restart
    - Mitigation: periodic snapshot to disk (not implemented)
  🔴 HIGH: No auth system — all users are trusted
    - Mitigation: add JWT auth (out of scope for mock)
  🟡 MED: Tombstone GC — if GC fails, memory grows unbounded
    - Mitigation: configurable TTL + manual GC trigger
  🟡 MED: HLC clock drift — if system clock jumps, HLC may conflict
    - Mitigation: NTP sync (external dependency)
  🟢 LOW: Fractional index precision — after many inserts, overflow
    - Mitigation: periodic rebalancing (O(n))

[2026-06-26 13:05] REVIEWER: === SCALABILITY ISSUES ===
  - Single node: all workspaces in one process
  - Multi-tenant isolation works at data layer, but CPU is shared
  - 1000 concurrent users → event queue may grow
  - No sharding: all workspaces in one Map
  - Recommendation: workspace-level partitioning

[2026-06-26 13:05] REVIEWER: === DATA CONSISTENCY RISKS ===
  - Eventual consistency: correct by design (CRDT)
  - But: пользователь может видеть stale state до sync
  - Conflict resolution: LWW может перезаписать важные данные
    - User A: "Hello World"
    - User B: "Goodbye World" (LWW → Goodbye, если позже)
    - Потеря "Hello" — фундаментальное свойство LWW
  - Recommendation: добавить manual resolve flag для critical content

